  "details": "Basically, you can select people from your friends list, and invite them to your home, but not a regular invite, it’s like a group, once you invite somebody and they accept it, you’ll get a new option on your menu that allows you to manage the people in your home and every time you both log on, you’ll be in the same instance at the same time, making you less lonely whenever you get into your home world, this feature should be called a “Household” and the notification will say “USER is inviting you to their household” once you accept this, you cannot change your home world, only the household owner can, if you want to change back to your home, you’ll need to ask the owner, or leave the household",
